<title>THAILAND: Thai Danu to go ahead with Finance One merger.</title>
<headline>Thai Danu to go ahead with Finance One merger.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thai Danu Bank Plc will go ahead with its plan to merge with Finance One Plc because the due diligence process has gone too far to change to a take over, a Thai Danu Bank official said on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;We will continue our plan to merge with Finance One. The due diligence process is nearly completed. It's unwise to go back from the beginning again,&quot; a Thai Danu Bank official, who asked not to be indentified, told Reuters.</p>
</text>
